d 'WASSTEST': module to perform a k-sample Wasserstein distance equality-of-distributions test
d
d  wasstest performs a (optionally weighted) k-sample Wasserstein
d distance permutation test to assess whether k >= 2 samples come
d from the same distribution. It is the k-sample generalization of
d the two-sample Wasserstein test (see Ramdas et al. 2017; Villani
d 2009).  When k > 2, there is no single pairwise comparison to
d make, so wasstest instead compares each group's empirical CDF to
d the (weighted) pooled empirical CDF of all groups combined. 
d
d KW: equality of distributions
d KW: k-sample
d KW: comparisons
d
d Requires: Stata version 11
d
d Distribution-Date: 20260820
d
d Author: Ariel Linden, Linden Consulting Group, LLC
d Support: email alinden@@lindenconsulting.org
d
f wasstest.ado
